# S57's flight in the original, wall-clock, from slot 7 (the plane standing on the runway):
# L1 alone, R1 alone, the L1+R1 chord on the ground; take off and dive into the ground, wait the
# wreck out; take off again, dive in, and end the wreck with the chord.
release
sleep 3000
press l1 600
sleep 2500
press r1 600
sleep 2500
down l1
down r1
sleep 600
up l1
up r1
sleep 4000
# take off
down cross
sleep 7000
down down
sleep 2500
up down
sleep 1500
# dive in
down up
sleep 6000
up up
sleep 8000
up cross
sleep 3000
# again, and the chord in the wreck
down cross
sleep 7000
down down
sleep 2500
up down
sleep 1500
down up
sleep 6000
up up
sleep 2000
down l1
down r1
sleep 600
up l1
up r1
sleep 4000
up cross
sleep 3000
release
